# BrandForge

BrandForge is a premium SaaS MVP for creating complete brand identity systems. It includes a public marketing page, protected dashboard, multi-step brand wizard, SVG-based logo editor, palette generator, typography workspace, mockup mockup scene generator, and export-ready brand guideline flows.

## Stack

- React + TypeScript
- Vite
- Tailwind CSS
- React Router
- Lucide icons
- jsPDF + JSZip for export flows

## Scripts

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
npm run build
```

## Architecture notes

This repository is structured as a production-style starter for the BrandForge MVP. The app is built to support future Supabase, Postgres, AI provider integration, and richer export tooling.

## Demo mode

The current implementation uses deterministic demo data and local session state to simulate a real SaaS experience without exposing secrets or fake payment integration.

## Planned phases

- Marketing website and design system
- Authentication and protected routes
- Brand creation wizard
- Logo studio and design tools
- Palette and typography systems
- Mockup generation and guidelines export
- Database and secure production integration
